{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add-ons extend your project with auth, databases, deployment, and more."}]},{"type":"code","value":"tanstack create my-app --add-ons tanstack-query,clerk,drizzle","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"discover-add-ons","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Discover Add-ons"}]},{"type":"code","value":"# List all available add-ons\ntanstack create --list-add-ons\n\n# Show details for a specific add-on (dependencies, options, conflicts)\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk","lang":"bash"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"what-add-ons-provide","children":[{"type":"text","value":"What Add-ons Provide"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Files"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Source code in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/integrations/"},{"type":"text","value":", demo routes in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"src/routes/demo/"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Dependencies"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Merged into "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"package.json"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Hooks"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Code injection (providers, Vite plugins, devtools)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Env vars"}]},{"type":"text","value":": Added to "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".env.example"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"create-custom-add-ons","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Create Custom Add-ons"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"See "},{"type":"link","href":"./creating-add-ons.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Creating Add-ons"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"discover-add-ons","text":"Discover Add-ons","level":2},{"id":"what-add-ons-provide","text":"What Add-ons Provide","level":2},{"id":"create-custom-add-ons","text":"Create Custom Add-ons","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nAdd-ons extend your project with auth, databases, deployment, and more.\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons tanstack-query,clerk,drizzle\n```\n\n## Discover Add-ons\n\n```bash\n# List all available add-ons\ntanstack create --list-add-ons\n\n# Show details for a specific add-on (dependencies, options, conflicts)\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk\n```\n\n## What Add-ons Provide\n\n- **Files**: Source code in `src/integrations/`, demo routes in `src/routes/demo/`\n- **Dependencies**: Merged into `package.json`\n- **Hooks**: Code injection (providers, Vite plugins, devtools)\n- **Env vars**: Added to `.env.example`\n\n## Create Custom Add-ons\n\nSee [Creating Add-ons](./creating-add-ons.md).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: add-ons\ntitle: Add-ons\n---\n\nAdd-ons extend your project with auth, databases, deployment, and more.\n\n```bash\ntanstack create my-app --add-ons tanstack-query,clerk,drizzle\n```\n\n## Discover Add-ons\n\n```bash\n# List all available add-ons\ntanstack create --list-add-ons\n\n# Show details for a specific add-on (dependencies, options, conflicts)\ntanstack create --addon-details clerk\n```\n\n## What Add-ons Provide\n\n- **Files**: Source code in `src/integrations/`, demo routes in `src/routes/demo/`\n- **Dependencies**: Merged into `package.json`\n- **Hooks**: Code injection (providers, Vite plugins, devtools)\n- **Env vars**: Added to `.env.example`\n\n## Create Custom Add-ons\n\nSee [Creating Add-ons](./creating-add-ons.md).\n"}
